    "body": "Added a timeout mechanism to the SPI disable process.\r\n\r\nWhen running STM32H563ZI on NUCLEO-H563ZI at 250MHz the SPI is disable already during last clock cycle of the sent data bit which is a little bit to early and the clock high signal is teared down. Better to check the TXC flag (TxFIFO transmission complete)  in the status register (SPI_SR) and wait until  it is 1 (= last TxFIFO frame transmission complete).\r\n------",
